# Build-context exclusions for apps/api/Dockerfile and apps/web/Dockerfile (context = repo root).
# They COPY packages/, apps/*, config/, workspace package.json files and the lockfile, so source
# (apps/*/src, packages/*/src) and config/ai-routing.yaml must stay IN the context.

# VCS and dependencies (installed inside the image)
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# secrets -- never in a build context (public remote; image layers are extractable)
.env
**/.env
.env.*
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
config/client_secret.json
**/client_secret*.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
data/bot-profile
**/credentials*.json

# data, recordings, QA and lane worktrees: not needed to build
raw
data
qa
KnowledgeBase-lanes
**/recordings
**/Recordings
reference
.playwright-mcp
**/.playwright-mcp
.playwright-cli
.pnpm-store
.venv
.cache
.handoffs
.claude
tmp
*.log
HANDOFF.md
**/__pycache__
